            "title": "Antivirus software",
            "text": "Antivirus software protects a computer from harmful programs such as spyware."
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "When you download a file, the antivirus checks it for hidden threats; a safe file opens normally, while a harmful one triggers an alert and is blocked."
          }
        ]
